docs {
  # Dashboard API
  
  Endpoints untuk dashboard user (statistik proposal).
  
  ## Base URL
  `/api/dashboard`
  
  ## Endpoints Overview
  
  | Method | Endpoint | Auth | Role | Description |
  |--------|----------|------|------|-------------|
  | GET | /latest-statuses | ✅ | All | Status usulan terakhir |
  | GET | /counts | ✅ | All | Jumlah proposal per kategori |
  
  ## Roles Allowed
  - admin
  - dosen
  - mahasiswa
}
